      "instance_name": "Adolf_Hitler",
      "label": "Adolf Hitler",
      "description": "The dictator of Nazi Germany from 1933 until his death in 1945. He is responsible for initiating World War II and orchestrating the Holocaust, which resulted in the deaths of approximately 6 million Jews and millions of others. The meme uses his image to represent a mass murderer, and the text references his historical responsibility for genocide.",
