      "instance_name": "Holocaust_denial_minimization_themes",
      "label": "Holocaust denial/minimization themes",
      "description": "The act of downplaying, denying, or trivializing the Holocaust and its scale of human suffering. The meme's text 'so another dozen or so won't hurt!' is a direct example of this theme, as it mocks the gravity of genocide by reducing it to a casual, almost mundane, attitude. This is a form of antisemitic tropes that is deeply offensive.",
