      "label": "Puppet master imagery",
      "description": "A metaphorical or visual representation of someone who controls or manipulates others, often used to describe powerful figures who orchestrate events from behind the scenes. While not explicitly shown, the meme implies Hitler as a 'puppet master' of global events and death, which is a common antisemitic trope.",
