      "description": "An individual who kills a large number of people, often in a single event or over a period of time. The meme uses this concept to describe Hitler, whose regime was responsible for the deaths of millions. The text 'I'm responsible for the deaths of over 50 million people!' is a direct reference to this concept.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
