      "description": "Humor derived from morbid, tragic, or taboo subjects. The meme uses dark humor to create a grotesque analogy by juxtaposing the image of Hitler with a callous, casual attitude toward death. This is a common trope in satirical memes, but in this case, it is deeply offensive due to the subject matter.",
