      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3cd5454b",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "callousness",
      "label": "the callous emotion",
      "description": "An emotional state characterized by a lack of concern or compassion, especially in the face of suffering or death. This is expressed through the text 'so another dozen or so won't hurt!' which mocks the gravity of genocide by reducing massive loss of life to a casual, almost mundane, attitude.",
